6-10-19T10:00:01Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50189530/san-francisco-49ers-brock-purdy-layering-football", "teams": ["SF"], "text": "How 49ers QB Brock Purdy mastered the art of layering passes over defenders. Purdy is terrific at layering the football -- fitting it perfectly between the second and third levels of the defense. And it's a big reason why he's playing at an MVP level this season.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Todd Archer", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-19T07:35:12Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50216409/cowboys-left-searching-answers-offense-woeful-showing-vs-packers", "teams": ["DAL"], "text": "Brian Schottenheimer: Cowboys offense 'a little bit one-sided,' needs balance. A talent-rich offense that is completely healthy has scored only 29 points in the past two games, leaving the Cowboys searching for answers everywhere.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Todd Archer", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-19T06:21:02Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50215480/cowboys-returner-kavontae-turpin-injures-rib-opening-kickoff-vs-packers", "teams": ["DAL"], "text": "Cowboys returner KaVontae Turpin injures rib on opening kickoff; X-rays clean. Cowboys Pro Bowl returner Turpin sustained a rib injury on his opening kickoff return after he was tackled awkwardly. X-rays were clean, according to coach Brian Schottenheimer.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "ESPN", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-19T05:28:28Z", "url": "http://www.espn.com/nfl/recap?gameId=401873007", "teams": ["GB", "DAL"], "text": "Jordan Love, Green Bay's defense lead the way in Packers' 23-13 victory over Cowboys. \u2014 Green Bay Packers quarterback Jordan Love didn\u2019t bother wondering what might have been.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Rob Demovsky and Todd Archer", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-19T04:22:04Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50190741/packers-beat-cowboys-sunday-night-football-jordan-love", "teams": ["DAL", "GB"], "text": "Packers use timely turnovers, third-down conversions to beat struggling Cowboys. The Packers used timely third-down conversions and a few big defensive plays to topple a scuffling Cowboys squad.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Anthony Gharib", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-19T03:47:51Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50215829/harbaugh-mum-mcdaniel-chargers-need-address-everything", "teams": ["LAC"], "text": "Harbaugh mum on McDaniel, says Chargers need 'to address everything'. Jim Harbaugh said his Chargers will \"have to address everything, and especially offensively\" after another dismal performance in a 22-6 loss to the Chiefs.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "ESPN", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-19T03:47:01Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/video/clip/_/id/50216129/packers-dismantle-cowboys-snf", "teams": ["DAL", "GB"], "text": "Packers dismantle Cowboys on SNF. Packers dismantle Cowboys on SNF ", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Brooke Pryor", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-19T03:43:06Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/49907062/aaron-rodgers-2026-nfl-season-steelers-packers-jets-tracking-records-milestones", "teams": ["PIT"], "text": "Aaron Rodgers' 2026 NFL season: Tracking records, milestones. The Steelers QB is chasing records in his 22nd NFL season, and ESPN is chronicling his \"last rodeo.\"", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Nate Taylor", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-19T03:38:02Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50215969/chiefs-patrick-mahomes-ties-tom-brady-fastest-100-career-wins", "teams": ["KC", "NE"], "text": "Chiefs' Patrick Mahomes earns 100th win in 131st start, tying Tom Brady. Quarterback Patrick Mahomes earned his 100th win with the Chiefs in his 131st regular-season start Sunday, tying Tom Brady for the